Module      : epdf-org
Product     : ePDF Engine — a clean-room, zero-dependency PDF engine and toolkit
              for Java (HTML/CSS/XML/SVG to PDF, PDF read/manipulate/merge,
              accessibility, optimisation, barcodes, international text).
Namespace   : com.epdfengine.rb.org
